    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8307" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνεξ-ήγητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
			<i>not to be told,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυστήρια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hsch.
				</span></i>
			
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σεμνά.</span>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>unexplained,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>UP</u>
				2.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Ph.</u>
				241.21
			</span></i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				9.95
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>unspeakable, ineffable,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέλαγος κάλλους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Them.
					<u>Or.</u>
					13.177d
				</span></i>
			.</div>
